      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "will wait for response and since we are trying to visit a site the browser will\nask the server to get site code and then server will send to code to render the \nnow this site render can happen at server level(dynamic/server side rendering)\nor client level(client side rendering) for ease purpose lets assume \nrendering will happen at client side so server will send html,css and js code \nand the browser will download that code once the code is download broswer will render\nit",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "will wait for response and since we are trying to visit a site the browser will\nask the server to get site code and then server will send to code to render the \nnow this site render can happen at server level(dynamic/server side rendering)\nor client level(client side rendering) for ease purpose lets assume \nrendering will happen at client side so server will send html,css and js code \nand the browser will download that code once the code is download broswer will render\nit",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
