      "versionNonce": 2123478669,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730172491141,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So all of these are hosted on google server and each have diffrent code base\nbut sever and infrastrucutre are same distiguised by routing / path routing\nof each website",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So all of these are hosted on google server and each have diffrent code base\nbut sever and infrastrucutre are same distiguised by routing / path routing\nof each website",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rQ3RouNXyg5lMF6G3J7dI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 381.45968662747094,
      "y": 17239.703373014978,
      "width": 1786.399658203125,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bMM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1722610787,
      "version": 322,
      "versionNonce": 1731018157,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730172577160,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So when ever we try to ping gmail.com or mail.googl.com ,meet.google.com the ip address we get will redirect us \nto google as they are hosted on same infrastructure and due to cdn plus load balancing also which helps in diverting\ntraffic comming to those website",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So when ever we try to ping gmail.com or mail.googl.com ,meet.google.com the ip address we get will redirect us \nto google as they are hosted on same infrastructure and due to cdn plus load balancing also which helps in diverting\ntraffic comming to those website",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
