      "updated": 1730175044407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So when we try to access any website using the above schema we type:\nhttps://www.google.com \n\nso okay if we try to debug the above we have a https protocol \nbut we dont have a ip address or port well that's because \nwww.google.com is mapped to a ip address \nso instead of google.com we can use www.google.com ip address\nto get www.google.com ip address open cmd and type \n\n[ping www.google.com]\n ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So when we try to access any website using the above schema we type:\nhttps://www.google.com \n\nso okay if we try to debug the above we have a https protocol \nbut we dont have a ip address or port well that's because \nwww.google.com is mapped to a ip address \nso instead of google.com we can use www.google.com ip address\nto get www.google.com ip address open cmd and type \n\n[ping www.google.com]\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
