    {
      "id": "x8uFcl6REodlzTuLpbTDB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1087.5179674448455,
      "y": 55000.275936253915,
      "width": 1470.782140756919,
      "height": 182.0059082721216,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1322758797,
      "version": 175,
      "versionNonce": 1242692685,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730177835802,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "But this is not a feasible way as website are deployed on servers across\nthe sea and those server run on different network which is not accessible\nby us so knowing there ip address is very difficult so company buys\ndomain name which they bind with there ip address",
      "fontSize": 36.40118165442432,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "But this is not a feasible way as website are deployed on servers across the sea and those server run on different network which is not accessible by us so knowing there ip address is very difficult so company buys domain name which they bind with there ip address",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HjFCsGL0xNf9H1Tc5PfyP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1093.0619511875047,
      "y": 55274.04235591978,
      "width": 1322.8666936398029,
      "height": 182.00590827212164,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1906067651,
      "version": 208,
      "versionNonce": 1736729987,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730177847610,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Imagine the internet as a vast city. Each house in this city has a\nunique numerical address (IP address) to identify it. However,\nremembering these numbers for every house is impractical. That's\nwhere domain names come in.",
      "fontSize": 36.40118165442433,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Imagine the internet as a vast city. Each house in this city has a unique numerical address (IP address) to identify it. However, remembering these numbers for every house is impractical. That's where domain names come in.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WSIOgNb-7np5f6RRgd8MY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1097.978173355843,
      "y": 55631.50236035822,
      "width": 1309.8016129976975,
      "height": 182.00590827212164,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1002166509,
      "version": 184,
      "versionNonce": 185077165,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730177852953,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A domain name is like a street address. It's a human-readable\nname that corresponds to a specific IP address. For example,\ninstead of remembering 192.168.1.100, you can easily remember\ngoogle.com.",
      "fontSize": 36.40118165442433,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A domain name is like a street address. It's a human-readable name that corresponds to a specific IP address. For example, instead of remembering 192.168.1.100, you can easily remember google.com.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ED-U98g4PT1IgwvOPAvfx",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 1068.20970774845,
      "y": 55935.8125778466,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 501,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 493314787,
      "version": 34,
      "versionNonce": 252527235,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730177865117,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
