      "index": "bOU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1649159053,
      "version": 765,
      "versionNonce": 374405443,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730178642383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each route code may be different like /about will tell about the website /contact will provide \nthe contact detail of the company so the route are defined in server file and each route \nhas different code to handle the incomming request \n\nso server file act as a huge folder and the path or different section of website act like \nchild folder which are accessible through path or routing\n\nFolder:server(localhost)\n    |_(/)--index file or home directory\n    |_(/about)--about page\n\nso to use different folder or page we use routing with in respect to sever as parent folder:\nlocalhost/ will give home page and localhost/about will give the about page",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each route code may be different like /about will tell about the website /contact will provide \nthe contact detail of the company so the route are defined in server file and each route \nhas different code to handle the incomming request \n\nso server file act as a huge folder and the path or different section of website act like \nchild folder which are accessible through path or routing\n\nFolder:server(localhost)\n    |_(/)--index file or home directory\n    |_(/about)--about page\n\nso to use different folder or page we use routing with in respect to sever as parent folder:\nlocalhost/ will give home page and localhost/about will give the about page",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VS3deVme7S4MflXgBZobn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 784.2924709703364,
      "y": 65585.35717405094,
      "width": 1903.8907201802779,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
