      "text": "SO just like how we navigate directory in our local machine we can navigate files and folder served on server via\nrouting\n\nSo we have to access gmail.com :there are two ways \n1.Goto www.google.com and then type gmail",
      "fontSize": 34.25151319267169,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SO just like how we navigate directory in our local machine we can navigate files and folder served on server via routing \n\nSo we have to access gmail.com :there are two ways \n1.Goto www.google.com and then type gmail",
      "autoResize": false,
