      "updated": 1730191605029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is a recursive \ncallback function and this\nwill get called every time\nwe send new request or access\nnew route so every time\nwe will change route \nthe whole function will be called\ntop to bottom and so when we try to access\nnew path req.url will change:\n\nNow our html file are contained in one folder\nview so we can use switch statement \nbased the latest req.url value \nand whatever the value is based on that case\nvalue we will change path string to add that \nfilenname",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is a recursive \ncallback function and this\nwill get called every time\nwe send new request or access\nnew route so every time\nwe will change route \nthe whole function will be called\ntop to bottom and so when we try to access\nnew path req.url will change:\n\nNow our html file are contained in one folder\nview so we can use switch statement \nbased the latest req.url value \nand whatever the value is based on that case\nvalue we will change path string to add that \nfilenname",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
