      "text": "We are provided with inbuilt\n.get() .post() .put()\n.patch() and .delete() method\nto define the request type\nfor the path associated to this method\nhence we dont have to check manually",
      "fontSize": 25.678464471102615,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We are provided with inbuilt\n.get() .post() .put()\n.patch() and .delete() method\nto define the request type\nfor the path associated to this method\nhence we dont have to check manually",
