      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730247457490,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So as we can see that native http \nmodule make use of fs module to read file \nand serve it but express makes it very easy to \nserve html file using \n\nres-->.sendFile() method which makes the code \nshorter ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So as we can see that native http \nmodule make use of fs module to read file \nand serve it but express makes it very easy to \nserve html file using \n\nres-->.sendFile() method which makes the code \nshorter ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "E4PNWCV2VvvE5AcGVcdI8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 584.0153485527196,
      "y": 165613.25654240462,
      "width": 354.1998596191406,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2026580771,
      "version": 49,
      "versionNonce": 1081286285,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730247534121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is res.sendFile()?\n\nres.sendFile():\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is res.sendFile()?\n\nres.sendFile():\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WHK9SAS0W-1tHm702XhWn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 576.565660606357,
      "y": 165731.83072840312,
      "width": 979,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1515816963,
      "version": 34,
      "versionNonce": 1363188941,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730247557389,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The res.sendFile() method in Express is used to send a file as a response to the client. \nIt simplifies serving static files, such as HTML, images, or any other file types. \nHere’s a detailed explanation of how to use it:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The res.sendFile() method in Express is used to send a file as a response to the client. \nIt simplifies serving static files, such as HTML, images, or any other file types. \nHere’s a detailed explanation of how to use it:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
